      "writtenOn": "2026-10-19T09:59:45Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "PublicKey is set for every request here, but the schema only allows it when SlotId is 15 and the requester has a pre-provisioned key. Since SlotId is limited to 0-7, I think it would be better to leave PublicKey out. This came up on https://gerrit.openbmc.org/c/openbmc/bmcweb/+/95260 as well.",
      "revId": "351c6fc221d473b7ce2b6681db24f20e1ad937a7",
      "serverId": "adbd0a64-1f21-4d83-b585-671fe73cb6e4"
